  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\">안녕하세요 선생님</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\">제가 속한</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\">서울 학교간 교원학습공동체에서 </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\">기획하여 진행하게 된</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\">교사 대상 해커톤 행사가 있어서 안내해 드립니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\">[서울시 각 학교에 공문이 오늘 발송이 되었습니다]</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\">전체 행사명은</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">[2025 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">과학</span><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">·</span><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">수학</span><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">·</span><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">영재</span><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">·</span><span data-ke-size=\"size26\">메이커 수업사례 나눔]</span></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#10061; </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">일시</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">: 2025. 12. 11.(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">목</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">), 14:00~17:20</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">&#10061; </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">장소</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">: </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">바비엥</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">2 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">교육센터</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">* </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">지하 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">1</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">층</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">, </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">지상 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">3</span><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">층</span></p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">* (</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">주소</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">) </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">서울특별시 중구